61
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.306
- How are you?
- I'm great.

62
00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:18.391
This is my girlfriend. Elyse.

63
00:06:18.461 --> 00:06:19.059
Hey. what's going on?

64
00:06:19.129 --> 00:06:19.644
Nice to meet you.

65
00:06:19.714 --> 00:06:21.061
Nice to meet you. I'm Andy.

66
00:06:21.131 --> 00:06:24.231
Yeah. Andy and I.
we were in a band together

67
00:06:24.301 --> 00:06:25.719
